g\">NO FRIEND? NO PROBLEM!</h2>Never be lonely on the adventure, add those little BOT players to spice things up.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228320/extras/bda71c9e5fb5f030539b5cebd088a87d.poster.avif?t=1724753525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228320/extras/bda71c9e5fb5f030539b5cebd088a87d.webm?t=1724753525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228320/extras/bda71c9e5fb5f030539b5cebd088a87d.mp4?t=1724753525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
